    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d322-a2">

                <pb facs="0886" n="672" xml:id="pg672"/>

                <head>[Inclosure 2.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Legation</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Leon</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1871-05-15"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi>
                            15, 1871.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francisco Balladares</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c.:</hi></p>
                <p>I have the honor of acknowledging the receipt of your interesting note of the
                    11th instant, relating to the interoceanic canal across this republic, and will
                    not fail to submit it to my government by the earliest opportunity. The
                    “documents relative to the principal studies had on the subject” have, as yet,
                    not reached me.</p>
                <p>I remain, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. N. RIOTTE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
